ind":"announcement","title":"Happy Birthday, Jane Perdita!","summary":"Happy Birthday, Jane Perdita!Today, October 10th 2026, is the day our beloved Jane Perdita was born!It was pure coincidence, but the timeline of the Laments games lined up such that Jane Perdita was born this year. So, we HAD to celebrate! Today, Platinum Rose AND Valiant Rose's demo are getting QoL updates. Valiant Rose has some new content just by virtue of things being added, but the primary purpose of the update is to make the demo better for what it is. I want my focus to be on completing t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T16:54:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936730","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4541860-1837955055364205","game_id":"steam-4541860","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo now available!","summary":"\"Laments of a Valiant Rose\" Free Demo now available!This game is a sequel to \"Laments of a Platinum Rose\" and should be played after completing that game.We are so excited to finally share this demo with you all! This demo will be about 1/5th of the game in terms of content. The download size is just shy of 600 MB. For the time being this demo exists solely by itself, but the full game will include compatibility with Achievements, Cloud Saves, and we're hoping tested compatibility with Steam Dec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T18:52:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4541860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"new